Package: rvgen
Title: Random Variable Generation by Inverse Transform and Acceptance-Rejection
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(c("Moses", "Kwame"), "Hovor", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mkhovor@gmail.com"),
    person("Juliet", "Seadey", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements two classical methods for generating random variables
    from uniform random numbers: the inverse-transform method and the
    acceptance-rejection method. Written for the STAT 8670 Computational
    Methods in Statistics course project.
